{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id43844339"}, "name":{"label":"k-town-guy"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-01-11T21:41:38-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.3.1"}, "id":{"label":"10812190752"}, "title":{"label":"Sync is Garbage"}, "content":{"label":"Concept of this app is great. Like the simplistic nature of it. But not good enough to replace a calendar as you can’t make edits to your calendar in it. \n\nThe sync is basically useless and in their help articles they blame this on iCloud. Why would you pick this if it has issues. 99% my sync doesn’t work and the help articles make zero help. Their support is slow and really not very helpful when I have reached out. \n\nTried this app before and the sync sucked. Thought I would try it again and it still sucks.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id1284405140"}, "name":{"label":"eatsoup334"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-01-08T22:02:20-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.3.1"}, "id":{"label":"10801215977"}, "title":{"label":"Awesome app!"}, "content":{"label":"This app is great and overall really useful, however I have one small problem with it. The fact that setting notification reminders is behind a paywall bothers me, especially as somebody with ADHD. I often struggle with remembering plans and actually staying on task, which is the main reason I downloaded this app. Without notifications, I’d only remember if I’m frequently checking it. (which I don’t do regularly) If you plan on updating features in the future, please make this free to the public!!! Huge letdown lol", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
